personas/design/design-whimsy-injector.md +Cadence: per-cycle delight summary; immediate short alert on obstruction findings or resentment signals on shipped moments.
personas/design/design-whimsy-injector.md +Escalation language: plain whole sentences, conclusion first — which moment/surface, what the evidence shows, experience exposure, recommended tuning.
