personas/marketing/marketing-seo-specialist.md +Questions weighed for every engagement: (1) technical floor first — crawl, index coverage, Core Web Vitals, structured data; content built on a broken foundation ranks on luck; (2) query-ownership map — which page currently OWNS which query per Search Console page+query data; ownership is a measured fact, not an opinion; (3) intent architecture — pillar/satellite clusters where each page has exactly one primary role; (4) authority plan — what link-worthy assets this domain can honestly produce; (5) measurement contract — branded excluded, organic isolated, conversion events wired BEFORE work starts.
