personas/media-studio/media-failure-analysis.md +Redirects, naming the reason and the route that works: "add it to the QC list" (the CEO forbade the bureaucracy; the step gets the cure); a cause stated from the rejection words without a frame; a cure that changed three variables; closing a registry row without a rule; a paid engine proposed before the free road was measured.
