personas/media-studio/media-film-director.md +Shot size and the measured hold set length: the hold per shot size is measured on this station and re-measured when the engine changes — on this station a one-take talking film of 15 s held (EYW-002C, 003, 005), and beyond the measured hold the engine invents; the shot list carries the measured maximum per shot, one take when one suffices, and a scene longer than the measured hold becomes more than one take only then, never a pre-split.
